---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { ADDRESS, COMPANY, CONTACT } from '../data/company';

const updated = '18 November 2026';
---

<Base title="Privacy policy" description={`How ${COMPANY.name} handles personal information on this website and when you contact us.`}>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <span class="eyebrow">Privacy policy</span>
      <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated {updated}.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tight">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p>
        This policy is for the website of {COMPANY.name} (Udyam Registration No. {COMPANY.udyam}), {ADDRESS.lines.join(', ')}
        ("we", "us"), at <a href={COMPANY.site}>{COMPANY.site.replace('https://', '')}</a>. Our products have their own
        privacy policies on their own websites - for example <a href="/products/kpk-schools/">KPK Schools</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What this website collects</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>No forms, no accounts, no cookies, no tracking.</strong> The website has no sign-in and no contact form, sets no cookies and uses no analytics or advertising tools.</li>
        <li>
          <strong>Technical details any website receives.</strong> The website is hosted by GitHub Pages (GitHub, Inc.). To
          deliver the pages and keep the service secure, GitHub receives what every browser sends - such as the IP address,
          the browser type and the page asked for - under <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" rel="noopener">GitHub's privacy statement</a>.
          We do not receive these details or use them to identify anyone.
        </li>
        <li><strong>Typefaces and pictures</strong> are served from this website itself; no other company is contacted when a page loads.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>When you contact us</h2>
      <p>
        If you call us, message us on WhatsApp or write to us, we receive your name, number or email address and what you
        tell us. We use it only to reply to you and, if you become a client, to do the work you ask for. We do not sell it or
        share it for anyone's marketing. WhatsApp is a service of Meta Platforms, under its own terms and privacy policy.
      </p>
      <p>We keep messages as long as the conversation or the work needs them, and then delete them unless the law asks us to keep a record (such as invoices).</p>

      <h2>Work for clients</h2>
      <p>
        When we build or run a website or software for a client, how we handle the personal information in it is agreed with
        that client in writing, and the client's own privacy policy tells its users about it.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You can ask us what personal information we hold about you, and ask us to correct or delete it, or withdraw your
        consent - under the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 and other Indian law. Write to us at the address below;
        we will reply within 30 days.
      </p>

      <h2>Grievances and contact</h2>
      <p>
        {COMPANY.founder}, {COMPANY.name}<br />
        {ADDRESS.lines.join(', ')}<br />
        Email: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT.email}`}>{CONTACT.email}</a> · Phone: <a href={CONTACT.phoneHref}>{CONTACT.phone}</a>
      </p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes, the new version is published on this page with its date.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
